>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Singer</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Periocular inflammation in mice with experimental systemic lupus erythematosus. A new experimental blepharitis and its modulation</article-title><source>J Immunol</source><year>1995</year><volume>154</volume><fpage>4830</fpage><lpage>4835</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7722331</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>